{"total_count":938,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3","id":3568021352,"node_id":"I_kwDOQLu5pc7Uq69o","number":3,"title":"Slippage Sentinel","user":{"login":"ponderingdemocritus","id":90423308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDIzMzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90423308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus","html_url":"https://github.com/ponderingdemocritus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ponderingdemocritus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9550858602,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaJag","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550858603,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaJaw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/defi","name":"defi","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550859097,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUaLWQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/risk-management","name":"risk-management","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9550883116,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQLu5pc8AAAACOUbpLA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/labels/$1000","name":"$1000","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":99,"created_at":"2025-10-29T21:45:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:43:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Purpose\nEstimate safe slippage tolerance for any route to prevent swap reverts.\n\n## Specification\n\n**Job:** Suggest safe slippage for a specific swap route.\n\n**Inputs:**\n- `token_in` - Input token address\n- `token_out` - Output token address\n- `amount_in` - Amount to swap\n- `route_hint` - Suggested route/DEX\n\n**Returns:**\n- `min_safe_slip_bps` - Minimum safe slippage in basis points\n- `pool_depths` - Liquidity depth data for route\n- `recent_trade_size_p95` - 95th percentile of recent trade sizes\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n✅ Slippage suggestion prevents revert for 95% of test swaps  \n✅ Accounts for pool depth and recent volatility  \n✅ **Must be deployed on a domain and reachable via x402**\n\n## Done When\nAgent provides slippage recommendations that demonstrably reduce swap failures.\n\n---\n\n## Basic Example\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { createAgentApp } from \"@lucid-dreams/agent-kit\";\n\nconst { app, addEntrypoint } = createAgentApp({\n  name: \"slippage-sentinel\",\n  version: \"0.1.0\",\n  description: \"Estimate safe slippage tolerance for any route\",\n});\n\naddEntrypoint({\n  key: \"echo\",\n  description: \"Echo a message\",\n  input: z.object({ text: z.string() }),\n  async handler({ input }) {\n    return {\n      output: { text: String(input.text ?? \"\") },\n      usage: { total_tokens: String(input.text ?? \"\").length },\n    };\n  },\n});\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n- [@lucid-dreams/agent-kit](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@lucid-dreams/agent-kit)\n\n## Submission\n**Submission is a PR into this repo linking the issue - first in first served if the bounty has been completed**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/daydreamsai/agent-bounties/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/issues/92","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/issues/92/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/issues/92/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/issues/92/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tscircuit/jlcsearch/issues/92","id":3492579756,"node_id":"I_kwDONJLUE87QLIms","number":92,"title":"Add `is_extended_promotional ` column to components (from data source)","user":{"login":"seveibar","id":1910070,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTAwNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1910070?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar","html_url":"https://github.com/seveibar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seveibar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7921659787,"node_id":"LA_kwDONJLUE88AAAAB2Crviw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/labels/%F0%9F%92%8E%20Bounty","name":"💎 Bounty","color":"4f46e5","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11003900875,"node_id":"LA_kwDONJLUE88AAAACj-Izyw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/labels/$1","name":"$1","color":"34d399","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":115,"created_at":"2025-10-07T18:30:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:23:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Some parts are \"extended promotional\" which means they act as basic for a limited time, we should have that information available in a filterable column\n\n/bounty $75","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/issues/92/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tscircuit/jlcsearch/issues/92/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2","id":4148310390,"node_id":"I_kwDORx6c0M73QjF2","number":2,"title":"[BOUNTY $75] TEMPLATE: CLAUDE.md for a Next.js + SQLite SaaS project","user":{"login":"claudebounty","id":271393208,"node_id":"U_kgDOEC0huA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271393208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty","html_url":"https://github.com/claudebounty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10532402505,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1SQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"D97706","default":false,"description":"Task with financial reward"},{"id":10532402633,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1yQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/template","name":"template","color":"2563EB","default":false,"description":"Project template"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1076,"created_at":"2026-03-27T00:55:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:21:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 💰 Bounty: $75 — powered by [Opire](https://opire.dev)\n\n## Description\nCreate an opinionated, production-ready `CLAUDE.md` for a typical SaaS project\nbuilt with Next.js 15 App Router and SQLite (better-sqlite3 or Turso).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Covers: project structure, naming conventions, DB migration rules\n- [ ] Includes: dev commands, patterns to follow, anti-patterns to avoid\n- [ ] Opinionated — not generic. Every rule has a reason.\n- [ ] Usable without modification on a greenfield Next.js + SQLite project\n- [ ] Tested: create a new project, paste the CLAUDE.md, confirm Claude Code\n      understands the context without asking clarifying questions\n\n## How to Claim\n1. Comment `/opire try` in this issue\n2. Submit a PR with your CLAUDE.md\n3. Payment is released automatically on merge ✅\n\n## Expected Sections\n- Stack & versions\n- Folder structure\n- SQL / migration conventions\n- Component patterns\n- What we don't do (and why)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinne