ingee.me/2026/07/06/395f4bee3ed780dd9246fbf1e2507b5f/)\n- 老范讲故事｜AI、大模型与商业世界的故事\n  - [ ] [Meta卖算力传闻后，AI行情为何三天剧震?](https://lukefan.com/2026/07/06/meta-ai-compute-tradable-cloud-asset/)\n  - [ ] [Palantir CEO破防怒骂OpenAI和Anthropic，他真正怕的是什么？](https://lukefan.com/2026/07/06/palantir-ceo-ai-agent-pricing-threat/)\n- est の 输入 输出和出入\n  - [ ] [或许「数羊」真是个有效的入睡法](https://blog.est.im/2026/stderr-23)\n- 吾爱破解论坛\n  - [ ] [基于文本匹配的VMP还原思路](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5Mjc3MDM2Mw==&mid=2651144621&idx=1&sn=69ef8eb1d2d840cfab3b6b1e61a7e196)\n- 墙外看\n  - [ ] [2026年好用的免费VPN推荐，在中国免费下载使用](https://qiangwaikan.com/free-vpn/)\n  - [ ] [2026年最佳日本VPN推荐(翻墙和解除地区限制)](https://qiangwaikan.com/ja-vpn/)\n  - [ ] [2026年7款优质便宜的VPN推荐-每月最低0.99美元](https://qiangwaikan.com/cheap-vpn/)\n- 静かな森\n  - [ ] [别让 404 唤醒你的 Vercel 函数](https://innei.in/posts/tech/dont-let-404-wake-your-vercel-function)\n- 非学·派'\n  - [ ] [儿子毕业典礼，刚开始就被大雨袭击了😅](https://fxpai.com/article/erzibiyedianligangkaishijiubeidayuxijile)\n- 烧饼博客\n  - [ ] [回归初心，文字为王](https://u.sb/writing-first/)\n- Lei Mao's Log Book\n  - [ ] [妈阁是座城](https://leimao.github.io/essay/%E5%A6%88%E9%98%81%E6%98%AF%E5%BA%A7%E5%9F%8E-A-City-Called-Macau-2019/)\n- 网安寻路人\n  - [ ] [AI智能体的系统架构与安全治理：从输出风险到行动风险](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIxODM0NDU4MQ==&mid=2247508643&idx=1&sn=c33c8a8ed4451345dd9d2609420cf79c)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Minkinx/sec-picker/issues/59/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Minkinx/sec-picker/issues/59/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187","id":3609136414,"node_id":"I_kwDOI9Wqc87XHw0e","number":32187,"title":"[Bounty $1500] LLVC (Low-Latency Low-Resource Voice Conversion) bring up using TTNN APIs","user":{"login":"tvardhineniTT","id":225911693,"node_id":"U_kgDODXcjjQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225911693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT","html_url":"https://github.com/tvardhineniTT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvardhineniTT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7931645110,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MNMtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":null},{"id":7931705304,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MQ32A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/bounty_difficulty/medium","name":"bounty_difficulty/medium","color":"EE8199","default":false,"description":"Medium Bounty"},{"id":9462912915,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAACNAiXkw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/model%20bringup","name":"model bringup","color":"fa8c2b","default":false,"description":"For model initialization or bring-up stage bounties"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":52,"created_at":"2025-11-10T18:07:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T05:25:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### 📝 Background\n\nThis bounty is for bringing up the **LLVC (Low-Latency Low-Resource Voice Conversion)** model using TTNN APIs on Tenstorrent hardware (Wormhole or Blackhole).\n\nLLVC is a real-time voice conversion model from Koe AI specifically optimized for low latency and CPU efficiency. Published in 2023, key features include:\n\n* **Ultra-low latency**: Designed for real-time voice conversion with minimal delay\n* **CPU-optimized**: Efficient enough to run on CPU in real-time\n* **Streaming support**: True streaming inference with chunked processing\n* **High quality**: Natural voice conversion while maintaining low latency\n* **Compatible architecture**: Based on RVC/QuickVC with optimizations\n* **Small model size**: Low resource requirements for edge deployment\n* **No F0 dependency**: Optional pitch-independent conversion mode\n* **MIT License**: Free for commercial use\n\nLLVC achieves real-time factor (RTF) < 0.1 on CPU, making it suitable for live applications like real-time dubbing, streaming, gaming voice chat, and interactive voice applications.\n\nThe goal is to enable this model to run on TT hardware for ultra-high-throughput, ultra-low-latency voice conversion optimized for real-time applications.\n\n\n### 🎯 What Success Looks Like\n\nA successful submission will fulfill all requirements in the following stages. Payout is made after all three stages are completed.\n\n\n### Stage 1 — Bring-Up\n\n* Implement LLVC using TTNN APIs (Python)\n* Implements the full generation pipeline:\n  * Lightweight encoder (optimized for low latency)\n  * Streaming-capable architecture\n  * Efficient decoder\n  * Optional pitch extraction (F0-based and F0-free modes)\n  * Vocoder integration\n* Model runs on either N150 or N300 Tenstorrent hardware with no errors\n* Supports both modes:\n  * **Streaming mode**: Real-time conversion with chunked processing\n  * **Non-streaming mode**: Full-context conversion\n* Produces valid converted audio output\n* Output is verifiable (audio quality assessment, compare with PyTorch reference)\n* Achieves baseline throughput target:\n  * At least 50 tokens/second for decoder generation\n  * Real-time factor (RTF) < 0.3 for streaming mode\n  * Latency < 100ms for streaming chunks\n* Accuracy evaluation:\n  * Speaker similarity > 70% (cosine similarity)\n  * Content preservation: WER < 3.0\n  * Token-level accuracy > 95% against PyTorch reference\n* Audio quality: Natural prosody with minimal artifacts despite low latency\n* Clear instructions for setup and running the model\n\n### Stage 2 — Basic Optimizations\n\n* Use optimal sharded/interleaved memory configs for encoder-decoder layers\n* Implement efficient sharding strategy for:\n  * Lightweight encoder layers\n  * Decoder layers optimized for streaming\n  * Convolutional layers with causal padding\n  * Cached convolution states for streaming\n  * Optional pitch extraction module\n* Fuse simple ops where possible (e.g., layer normalization, activation functions)\n* Store intermediate activations in L1 where beneficial\n* Use recommended TTNN/tt-metal flows for streaming audio models\n* Leverage TT library of fused ops for convolution blocks\n* Optimize chunk-based processing for streaming\n* Efficient state management for causal convolutions\n* Optimize vocoder integration\n\n### Stage 3 — Deeper Optimization\n\n* Maximize core counts used per inference\n* Implement deeper TT-specific optimizations:\n  * Ultra-low latency streaming (minimize chunk processing time)\n  * Efficient causal convolution with state caching\n  * Flash Attention or equivalent where applicable\n  * Minimize voice conversion latency per chunk\n  * Batch processing for multiple concurrent streams\n  * Pipeline encoder/decoder/vocoder stages\n  * Optimize memory footprint for edge deployment\n* Minimize memory and TM (tensor manipulation) overheads\n* Explore look-ahead strategies for quality vs latency trade-off\n* Document any advanced tuning, known limitations, or trade-offs\n* Target stretched goals:\n  * 100+ tokens/second generation speed\n  * RTF < 0.1 for streaming mode (match CPU performance)\n  * Latency < 50ms for streaming chunks\n  * Support for 10+ concurrent streams\n\n### 🧭 Guidance & Starting Points\n\n* Use the [TTNN model bring-up tech report](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/tech_reports/ttnn/TTNN-model-bringup.md) as your primary reference\n* Reference [streaming audio model patterns in tt-metal](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/demos) for streaming architectures\n* Use the [official LLVC repository](https://github.com/KoeAI/LLVC) for model architecture details\n* Refer to the [LLVC paper (arXiv:2311.00873)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.00873) for technical details\n* Check [LLVC demo page](https://koeai.github.io/llvc-demo/) for audio samples\n* Refer to [TT Fused ops PR #29236](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/pull/29236) for optimization opportunities\n* The model architecture consists of:\n  * **Lightweight encoder**: Optimized convolutional layers with reduced complexity\n  * **Cached convolutions**: State management for causal streaming inference\n  * **Efficient decoder**: Minimal layers for low latency\n  * **Optional F0 module**: Pitch extraction when needed\n  * **Vocoder**: HiFi-GAN or similar (can be shared with other models)\n* Key challenges:\n  * Ultra-low latency requirements (< 100ms)\n  * Streaming inference with causal convolutions\n  * State management across chunks\n  * Quality vs latency trade-off\n  * Vocoder integration and optimization\n  * Small model size constraints\n* Streaming parameters:\n  * `window_ms`: Chunk size in milliseconds (affects latency)\n  * `extra_convert_size`: Extra context for quality (affects latency)\n* Ask for help or file issues if ops are missing in TTNN\n\n\n### 🔎 Possible Approaches\n\n* Start from the [official LLVC repository](https://github.com/KoeAI/LLVC) and port components sequentially:\n  1. Lightweight encoder (optimized convolutions)\n  2. Cached convolution layers for streaming\n  3. Efficient decoder\n  4. Optional pitch extraction (F0 mode)\n  5. Vocoder integration\n  6. Streaming inference pipeline with state management\n* Validate each submodule's output against PyTorch reference before integration\n* Experiment with different sharding strategies:\n  * Channel sharding for convolutions\n  * Sequence length sharding for chunks\n  * Minimize cross-chip communication\n* Use TTNN profiling tools to identify bottlenecks in:\n  * Per-chunk processing time (critical metric)\n  * Encoder latency\n  * Decoder latency\n  * State management overhead\n  * Vocoder latency\n* Test diverse use cases:\n  * Streaming mode with various chunk sizes (50ms, 100ms, 200ms)\n  * Non-streaming mode for comparison\n  * F0-based vs F0-free modes\n  * Multiple concurrent streams\n  * Real-time conversion scenarios\n* Open a draft PR early to get feedback on your approach\n\n\n\n## 📊 Result Submission Guidelines\n\nBeyond the model implementation itself, contributors must submit the following material as proof of work.\nHowever, feel free to open a PR at any time if you want us checking that you are on the right track.\nJust understand that payout is only made after **all 3 stages** are completed.\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Functional model implementation\n- Validation logs (output correctness)\n- Performance report + header for final review\n\n**Links:**\n- [Performance Sheet](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/tech_reports/ttnn/TTNN-model-bringup.md#41-performance-sheet)\n- [Perf Header Docs](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/tt-metal/latest/ttnn/ttnn/profiling_ttnn_operations.html#perf-report-headers)\n\n\n### 📚 Resources\n\n### Model Resources\n\n* [LLVC Official Repository](https://github.com/KoeAI/LLVC)\n* [LLVC Paper (arXiv:2311.00873)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.00873)\n* [LLVC Demo Page](https://koeai.github.io/llvc-demo/)\n* [LLVC Paper PDF](https://koe.ai/papers/llvc.pdf)\n* [Koe AI Homepage](https://koe.ai/)\n* [RVC Repository (related)](https://github.com/RVC-Project/Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI)\n\n### TT-Metal Resources\n\n* [TTNN Model Bring-up Tech Report](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/tech_reports/ttnn/TTNN-model-bringup.md)\n* [Streaming Audio Models in tt-metal](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/demos)\n* [TT Fused Ops PR #29236](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/pull/29236)\n* [Performance Report Header](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/tt-metal/latest/ttnn/ttnn/profiling_ttnn_operations.html#perf-report-headers)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/32187/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786","id":4195438556,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EU_c","number":2786,"title":"[ONBOARD: 2 RTC] Compare RustChain to Another Blockchain Project","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":625,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:42:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T05:03:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 3 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nResearch RustChain and compare it to another blockchain project you know.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any other blockchain project**: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Ergo, Chia, whatever you know\n2. **Write a comparison** (300-800 words) covering:\n   - Consensus mechanism differences (PoW vs PoS vs PoA vs RustChain's Proof of Antiquity)\n   - Hardware requirements\n   - Environmental approach\n   - Community model\n   - What each project does better\n3. **Post as a comment here**\n\n### What Counts\n- Must show you actually read about both projects\n- Honest comparison, it's fine to say where RustChain falls short\n- We learn from your outside perspective\n- Tables/charts welcome but not required\n\n### Payment\n3 RTC for a thoughtful, accurate comparison.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 30-45 min | **Skills**: Research, writing\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devpool-directory/devpool-directory/issues/5924","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devpool-directory/devpool-directory","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devpool-directory/devpool-directory/issues/5924/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devpool-directory/devpool-directory/issues/5924/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devpool-directory/devpool-directory/issues/5924/events","html_url":"https://github.com/devpool-directory/devpool-directory/issues/5924","id":3885310528,"node_id":"I_kwDOJWyCVM7nlSJA","number":5924,"title":"Launch Another DoraHacks Bounty Post","user":{"login":"devpool-directory-superintendent[bot]","id":179499210,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCrLwyg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/979607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devpool-directory-superintendent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devpool-directory-superintendent%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9443193576,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWyCVM8AAAACMtuy6A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devpool-directory/devpool-directory/labels/Priority:%201%20(Normal)","name":"Priority: 1 (Normal)","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":9443194062,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWyCVM8AAAACMtu0zg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devpool-directory/devpoo