m/users/lcn2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lcn2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lcn2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lcn2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lcn2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lcn2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lcn2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Due to the fact that we have another issue that has had a number of OT comments I think it might be good to have a new mostly OT thread here rather than clutter the one in the other repo more or the issue for jprint.\r\n\r\nI had the thought of suggesting you reopen the other one but there's a comment there I don't want to get lost that I hope you can finish replying to (you were doing it in parts) when things are less busy here. I also wanted to see if anything in particular occurs if one uses the same name (I rather doubt it will but it popped into my head anyway).\r\n\r\nFeel free to assign this to me even though it's not technically an issue that has to be resolved.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioccc-src/mkiocccentry/issues/723/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioccc-src/mkiocccentry/issues/723/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/7199","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/7199/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/7199/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/7199/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/7199","id":1961939568,"node_id":"I_kwDOB3TbgM508NJw","number":7199,"title":"Diablo IV (2344520)","user":{"login":"christofin","id":43354771,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMzU0Nzcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43354771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin","html_url":"https://github.com/christofin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christofin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1032039901,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDMyMDM5OTAx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/labels/Game%20compatibility%20-%20Unofficial","name":"Game compatibility - Unofficial","color":"ea6e3c","default":false,"description":"Games not expected to work without issues"},{"id":1041498223,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDQxNDk4MjIz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/labels/Regression","name":"Regression","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"Confirmed working on an older version of Proton"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":77,"created_at":"2023-10-25T17:54:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T23:34:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Compatibility Report\r\n- Name of the game with compatibility issues: Diablo IV\r\n- Steam AppID of the game: 2344520\r\n\r\n## System Information\r\nSteam Deck - latest full 3.4.x release (NOT 3.5.1 preview)\r\n- Proton version: Proton Experimental - set by Valve in Game Properties (as of 10/25/2023)\r\n\r\n## I confirm:\r\n- [X] that I haven't found an existing compatibility report for this game.\r\n- [X] that I have checked whether there are updates for my system available.\r\n\r\n<!-- Please add `PROTON_LOG=1 %command%` to the game's launch options and\r\nattach the generated $HOME/steam-$APPID.log to this issue report as a file.\r\n(Proton logs compress well if needed.)-->\r\n\r\n## Symptoms: <!-- What's the problem? -->\r\nDiablo IV fails to reconnect to Blizzard servers after using the sleep/wake function. I'm not sure if this is a game issue or Proton, but the sleep/wake function on Playstation and Xbox work, so I'm reporting here for awareness. \r\n\r\n\r\n## Reproduction\r\n\r\nLaunch Diablo IV on Steam Deck\r\nConnect to Blizzard Servers, load into game after character select\r\nPut Steam Deck to Sleep\r\nWake Steam Deck back up\r\nYour character is still in the world, with \"Connecting to Diablo IV Servers\" in the upper left corner\r\nGame will fail to connect to Diablo IV servers, returns player to main menu\r\nGame fails to connect to Diablo IV servers in main menu, application exits to desktop\r\n\r\nExpected behavior is for the game to successfully reconnect to Blizzard servers and allow player to resume gameplay. \r\n\r\nNote that in a normal scenario (e.g. on Playstation and Xbox), any server or client related hotfixes or patches will result in showing the player an error and exit the application. This is normal behavior when there is a server & client mismatch. The issue I am describing here is NOT a result of server/client mismatch. This issue is reproducible 100% of the time, even when using the sleep function very briefly (e.g. under 2 minutes). ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/7199/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ValveSoftware/Proton/issues/7199/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/87754","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/87754/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/87754/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/87754/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/87754","id":4254831829,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc79m5TV","number":87754,"title":"[$250] Web - IOU - No error shown to user A after requested amount changes by user B and A reconnects","user":{"login":"vincdargento","id":35436778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NDM2Nzc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35436778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento","html_url":"https://github.com/vincdargento","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2873246102,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODczMjQ2MTAy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/External","name":"External","color":"a7b8ef","default":false,"description":"Added to denote the issue can be worked on by a contributor"},{"id":2893455829,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODkzNDU1ODI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Daily","name":"Daily","color":"eb6420","default":false,"description":"KSv2"},{"id":3184150925,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTg0MTUwOTI1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Overdue","name":"Overdue","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":""},{"id":4664850679,"node_id":"LA_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFgv49w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"93074F","default":false,"description":"Something is broken. Auto assigns a BugZero manager."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"youssef-lr","id":9680864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2ODA4NjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9680864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr","html_url":"https://github.com/youssef-lr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"ZhenjaHorbach","id":68128028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTI4MDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68128028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhenjaHorbach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhenjaHorbach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"KJ21-ENG","id":140263938,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFxCAg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140263938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG","html_url":"https://github.com/KJ21-ENG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KJ21-ENG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":64,"created_at":"2026-04-13T13:02:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T22:29:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"youssef-lr","id":9680864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2ODA4NjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9680864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr","html_url":"https://github.com/youssef-lr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/youssef-lr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.3.58-7\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/Expensify/issues/379640\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Regression TC Execution\n**Device used:** Windows 11/Chrome\n**App Component:** Chat Report View\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. User A invites User B to the Free workspace\n2. User B submits an expense\n3. User A goes offline\n4. User A taps ‘Pay’ on the original expense\n5. User B edits the expense amount OR adds an additional expense while User A is offline\n6. User A comes back online\n\n## Expected Result:\nConfirm the money request is not paid, and User A sees an error message: The requested amount has changed.\n\n## Actual Result:\nNo error message after user B changes the amount, and user A goes back online from the paid expense\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8849c8ed-2dbe-4304-8587-fd28cd78d0dd\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @c3024</details>\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022043678322317186179</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2043678322317186179</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-05-04</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/87754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/87754/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89966","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_ur