"Monthly","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"KSv2"},{"id":2893524800,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODkzNTI0ODAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Improvement","name":"Improvement","color":"604c8d","default":false,"description":"Item broken or needs improvement."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"wildan-m","id":11847279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODQ3Mjc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11847279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m","html_url":"https://github.com/wildan-m","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wildan-m/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"roryabraham","id":47436092,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NDM2MDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47436092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham","html_url":"https://github.com/roryabraham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"dylanexpensify","id":60117248,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTE3MjQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60117248?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify","html_url":"https://github.com/dylanexpensify","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylanexpensify/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"DylanDylann","id":141406735,"node_id":"U_kgDOCG2yDw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141406735?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann","html_url":"https://github.com/DylanDylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DylanDylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":57,"created_at":"2026-05-07T20:07:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:59:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"roryabraham","id":47436092,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NDM2MDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47436092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham","html_url":"https://github.com/roryabraham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roryabraham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When a user scans a receipt from the expenses page, the newly scanning expense gets a default date of \"00:00:00 UTC today\", which causes it to appear buried beneath other expenses created later that day. Users expect the scanning receipt to appear at the top of the list so they can easily track it.\n\n## Proposed Solution\n\nShow \"Scanning\" instead of the date for scanning receipts, and sort them to the top of the expenses list. No backend changes needed — the display and sort are purely frontend concerns.\n\n### 1. Show \"Scanning\" instead of the date\n\nThere's already a precedent — the merchant column does exactly this at [`TransactionItemRow/index.tsx:159-161`](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/d166392bc802b639bed97d96343a279a3619ec6f/src/components/TransactionItemRow/index.tsx#L159-L161):\n```ts\nif (isScanning(transactionItem) && shouldShowMerchant) {\n    merchant = translate('iou.receiptStatusTitle');\n}\n```\n\nApply the same pattern for the date column at the two `DateCell` call sites:\n- **Wide layout:** [`TransactionItemRow/index.tsx:326`](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/d166392bc802b639bed97d96343a279a3619ec6f/src/components/TransactionItemRow/index.tsx#L326) — pass `translate('iou.receiptStatusTitle')` instead of `createdAt` when `isScanning(transactionItem)` is true\n- **Narrow layout:** [`TransactionItemRow/index.tsx:736`](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/d166392bc802b639bed97d96343a279a3619ec6f/src/components/TransactionItemRow/index.tsx#L736) — same change\n\n[`DateCell.tsx`](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/d166392bc802b639bed97d96343a279a3619ec6f/src/components/Search/SearchList/ListItem/DateCell.tsx) would need a small tweak to skip date formatting when the value isn't a real date (or accept a `displayText` override prop).\n\n### 2. Sort scanning receipts to top\n\nAdd scanning-priority logic in the two sort locations, **before** the normal `compareValues` call:\n\n- **Search/expenses list:** [`SearchUIUtils.ts` (`getSortedTransactionData`)](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/d166392bc802b639bed97d96343a279a3619ec6f/src/libs/SearchUIUtils.ts#L3590) — inside the `.sort()` callback, check `isScanning(a)` / `isScanning(b)` first. If one is scanning and the other isn't, return the scanning one first (regardless of sort direction).\n- **Report transaction list:** [`MoneyRequestReportTransactionList.tsx:286`](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/d166392bc802b639bed97d96343a279a3619ec6f/src/components/MoneyRequestReportView/MoneyRequestReportTransactionList.tsx#L286) — same wrapper logic around `compareValues`.\n\n### 3. No backend changes needed\n\nThe `created` date stays as today's date (no fake future dates). [`isScanning`](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/d166392bc802b639bed97d96343a279a3619ec6f/src/libs/TransactionUtils/index.ts#L1403-L1415) already detects the scanning state from `receipt.state`, and once SmartScan completes, `isScanning` returns false and the expense reverts to normal date display + sort position automatically.\n\n---\n\n**Parent issue:** https://github.com/Expensify/Expensify/issues/630432\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022052481085379087969</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2052481085379087969</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-04</li>\n<li>Automatic offers: </li>\n<ul>\n<li>wildan-m | Contributor | 111662556</li>\n</ul></li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @wildan-m</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89966/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94720","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94720/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94720/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94720/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94720","id":4753728467,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABG1gj0w"