?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny","html_url":"https://github.com/mountiny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91302","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Sentry\nhttps://expensify.sentry.io/issues/APP-25V\n\n## Impact (snapshot at filing)\n- Users (total since first seen): **1,938**\n- Events: 4,178\n- Users (last 14d, releases 9.3.89–9.3.91): 3\n- First seen: 2025-12-05\n- Last seen: now (ongoing)\n- Platform: iOS, hybrid_app\n- App version(s): seen on 9.3.59 through 9.3.91\n- Mechanism: `mach`, fatal\n\n## Stack trace (top frames, first-party only)\n```\nfacebook::react::RuntimeScheduler_Modern::runEventLoopTick\n  -> facebook::react::RuntimeScheduler_Modern::runEventLoop\n  -> facebook::react::RCTMessageThread::runAsync\n  -> RCT JSThread run loop\n```\n\n## Suspected cause\nRN Fabric/modern scheduler memory corruption or use-after-free on the JS thread during an event-loop tick. Stack is native-only (no app JS frames), so the fix may require a React Native upgrade or platform-team investigation.\n\n## Reproduction\nUnknown deterministically — fires on the RN JS thread under load on HybridApp iOS. See linked Sentry events.\n\n## Related\n- Sibling Sentry IDs (if any): none identified\n- Prior GH issues: none\n- Production scan: releases 9.3.89, 9.3.90, 9.3.91 (2026-06-02)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885259834583946\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885259834583946</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2061885259834583946</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-16</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039","id":2069553289,"node_id":"I_kwDOEjAjqs57WuCJ","number":3039,"title":"Bounty: Fast parallel scan (Mamba, etc). ","user":{"login":"Algomancer","id":13579432,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTc5NDMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13579432?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer","html_url":"https://github.com/Algomancer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Algomancer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5546470278,"node_id":"LA_kwDOEjAjqs8AAAABSphrhg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Active Bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":17,"created_at":"2024-01-08T03:26:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:16:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"It would be great to have a general parallel prefix sum (associative scan) operation in tinygrad, something like [associative_scan](https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_autosummary/jax.lax.associative_scan.html) in JAX or [scan_associative](https://www.tensorflow.org/probability/api_docs/python/tfp/math/scan_associative) in TensorFlow Probability. This operation is key for the parallelization of some algorithms in CRFs, [filtering/smoothing in state space models](https://github.com/EEA-sensors/sequential-parallelization-examples/blob/main/python/temporal-parallelization-bayes-smoothers/parallel_kalman_jax.ipynb), mamba etc.\r\n\r\nAdditional Reference\r\n\r\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2311.06281\r\n---\r\n\r\nCurrent Bounty: $500\r\nTo lock the bounty submit a draft PR with a decent amount of progress made\r\nMake sure to reference this issue in the PR for future tracking\r\n\r\nNotice: If the PR goes stale the bounty will be unlocked\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tinygrad/tinygrad/issues/3039/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/events","html_url":"https://github.com/asyncapi/website/issues/3186","id":2501479656,"node_id":"I_kwDOBW5R_c6VGYzo","number":3186,"title":"[FEATURE] Performance + Accessibility Improvement of website","user":{"login":"akshatnema","id":76521428,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTIxNDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76521428?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema","html_url":"https://github.com/akshatnema","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akshatnema/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":603919132,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDM5MTkxMzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"84b6eb","default":true,"description":null},{"id":1907431320,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTA3NDMxMzIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/Epic","name":"Epic","color":"3E4B9E","default":false,"description":null},{"id":5407684713,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBW5R_c8AAAABQlK4aQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"AsyncAPI Bounty program related label"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2024-09-02T19:07:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:30:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"patilpratik1905","id":153302730,"node_id":"U_kgDOCSM2yg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153302730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905","html_url":"https://github.com/patilpratik1905","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patilpratik1905/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Why do we need this improvement?\n\nWith the addition of multiple components, pages and MD files, it's now important for us, to make the website efficient for all web + mobile users. Currently, the performance of the website has critically low numbers in both web and mobile view, which can impact the efficiency and user views in the website. \r\n\r\nOn the other hand, it's also important that we add the necessary accessibility labels to the website. Currently, with the addition of many new illustrations, we have not added label elements for these tags.\n\n### How will this change help?\n\nThe performance improvement will help the website render the contents more efficiently to the users and will drastically enhance lighthouse key metrics.\n\n### Screenshots\n\nSome screenshots of lighthouse reports:\r\n<img width=\"638\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acfee5f2-bdf5-477e-92c9-92ee585ef731\">\r\n\r\n\n\n### How could it be implemented/designed?\n\nFollowing tasks need to be done in this issue:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make proper research + analysis on what needs to be fixed to improve performance in both mobile + web view.\r\n- [ ] Propose the solution to improve the performance of website, at least 95% on each page.\r\n- [ ] Search for the elements that require labels to improve accessibility.\r\n- [ ] Create a workflow to analyse lighthouse reports for each page (not docs, blogs or any mdx rendered page0\n\n### 🚧 Breaking changes\n\nYes\n\n### 👀 Have you checked for similar open issues?\n\n- [X] I checked and didn't find a similar issue\n\n### 🏢 Have you read the Contributing Guidelines?\n\n- [X] I have read the [Contributing Guidelines](https://github.com/asyncapi/.github/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n\n### Are you willing to work on this issue?\n\nNone","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asyncapi/website/issues/3186/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269","id":3953219900,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87roVk8","number":269,"title":"[BOUNTY] Silicon Archaeology: Hardware Scanner Module (7 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":28,"created_at":"2026-02-17T15:03:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:55:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Build the Hardware Scanner for silicon-archaeology-skill\n\n**Reward: 10 RTC**\n\n### What To Do\nCreate `scanner.py` for [silicon-archaeology-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/silicon-archaeology-skill) that detects and fingerprints vintage hardware.\n\n### Requirements\n- Detect CPU family from `/proc/cpuinfo`, `sysctl`, or platform module\n- Classify into Silicon Epochs (0-4) per the README table\n- Output structured JSON: `{family, model, epoch, year_estimate, rustchain_multiplier}`\n- Work on Linux, macOS, and PowerPC\n\n### How To Claim\n1. Fork `silicon-archaeology-skill`, add `silicon_archaeology/scanner.py`\n2. Open a PR with working code + basic tests\n3. Include your RTC wallet name\n\n> Start mining: `pip install clawrtc && clawrtc --wallet your-name`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","id":3904273917,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otn39","number":66,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":88,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:51:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits\n\n**Reward: 100 RTC** (~$10 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe x402/8004 HTTP Payment Protocol implementation merged in Rustchain PR #5 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `x402/` directory in Rustchain repo\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Payment Replay:** Can you replay a payment header to get service without paying twice?\n2. **Amount Manipulation:** Can you modify payment amount after signing?\n3. **Receipt Forgery:** Can you forge a valid payment receipt?\n4. **Middleware Bypass:** Can you access protected endpoints without valid RTC payment?\n5. **Double-Spend via x402:** Can you spend the same RTC through x402 and direct API simultaneously?\n6. **Client Impersonation:** Can you use someone else's payment credentials?\n\n### Rules\n- Document each vulnerability with reproduction steps\n- Classify severity (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggest fix for each finding\n- Do NOT exploit against production — test locally or on a test node\n- Responsible disclosure: report here first, don't publicize until fixed\n\n### Payout Scale\n| Severity | Bonus |\n|----------|-------|\n| Critical (fund drain) | +100 RTC |\n| High (auth bypass) | +50 RTC |\n| Medium (info leak) | +25 RTC |\n| Low (edge case) | Base 100 RTC |\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with PoC for each finding\n- Suggested fixes\n- PR with patches (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment with your security testing background.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","id":3974806452,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6ru0","number":397,"title":"[QUEST] Become a RustChain Miner — 5 Steps, 50 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:24:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:45:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Become a RustChain Miner\n\nComplete each step in order. Each step unlocks the next. **50 RTC total** for completing the full chain.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Install and Run (5 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\npip install clawrtc\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME --dry-run\n\\`\\`\\`\n**Prove it:** Screenshot or paste your \\`--dry-run\\` output showing your hardware fingerprint.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Mine Your First Block (10 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\nRun the miner for at least 1 hour on real hardware (not a VM — our fingerprinting will detect it).\n\n**Prove it:** Paste the output showing a successful attestation, or we'll verify via the API:\n\\`curl -s https://50.28.86.131/api/miners | python3 -m json.tool\\`\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Understand the Consensus (10 RTC)\nRead the RIP-200 documentation and answer these 3 questions in a comment:\n1. Why does a PowerPC G4 earn more RTC than a modern x86 CPU?\n2. What are the 6 hardware fingerprint checks that prevent VM farming?\n3. What is the current epoch reward pot and how is it distributed?\n\n**No copying from docs** — explain in your own words. We can tell.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Port or Improve (15 RTC)\nDo ONE of the following:\n- **Port the miner** to a new platform (Raspberry Pi, RISC-V, old laptop, etc.) and document the process\n- **File a detailed bug report** with reproduction steps from your mining experience\n- **Improve the miner code** — submit a PR that fixes something you encountered during Steps 1-3\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your PR, bug report, or write-up.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Teach Someone Else (10 RTC)\nWrite a tutorial, blog post, or video showing someone else how to mine RustChain. Publish it on Dev.to, Medium, YouTube, or your personal blog.\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your published content. Must include:\n- The \\`pip install clawrtc\\` command\n- Your mining experience\n- Link back to this repo\n\n---\n\n### Completion Bonus\n\nComplete all 5 steps → **50 RTC total** + **Miner tier** on the Contributor Ladder + your name on the Wall of Miners at rustchain.org.\n\n### How to Claim\n\nComment on this issue after completing each step with your proof. We verify and pay per step. You don't have to complete all 5 at once — take your time.\n\n\\`\\`\\`\nStep completed: 1\nProof: [screenshot/link/paste]\nRTC wallet: YOUR_WALLET_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n---\n\n*Quest chains require real effort and understanding. This is how you become a real RustChain community member, not just a bounty claimer.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732","id":4036839936,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wnUoA","number":732,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5-7 RTC] Write Video Generation Guides for BoTTube Agents","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":31,"created_at":"2026-03-07T00:53:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:40:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Write Video Generation Guides for BoTTube Agents\n\n### The Bounty\n\nCreate tutorials showing AI agents (and humans) how to generate videos using different tools and upload them to [BoTTube](https://bottube.ai).\n\n### Payout\n\n**5 RTC per guide** — max 3 guides per person (15 RTC total).\n\n### Guide Topics Needed\n\nEach guide should cover one video generation method end-to-end: generate → prepare → upload to BoTTube.\n\n| # | Topic | Difficulty |\n|---|-------|------------|\n| 1 | **LTX-Video** — text-to-video with ComfyUI workflow | Medium |\n| 2 | **Runway Gen-3** — API-based cinematic video generation | Easy |\n| 3 | **Kling AI** — text/image-to-video with motion control | Easy |\n| 4 | **Pika Labs** — stylized short-form video generation | Easy |\n| 5 | **Stable Video Diffusion** — image-to-video locally | Medium |\n| 6 | **Meshy 3D → Turntable** — 3D model generation + Blender render | Medium |\n| 7 | **ffmpeg Recipes** — text overlays, slideshows, effects from static images | Easy |\n| 8 | **Remotion** — programmatic React-based video (data viz, animations) | Medium |\n| 9 | **Deforum / AnimateDiff** — Stable Diffusion animation pipelines | Medium |\n| 10 | **HeyGen / D-ID** — AI avatar talking head videos | Easy |\n| 11 | **Invideo AI** — prompt-to-full-video with narration | Easy |\n| 12 | **Sora / Veo** — frontier model video generation | Easy |\n\nOr propose your own — any method that produces videos suitable for BoTTube.\n\n### What Each Guide Must Include\n\n1. **Tool overview** — what it is, free vs paid, API vs web UI\n2. **Step-by-step instructions** with screenshots or terminal output\n3. **BoTTube prep** — how to meet upload constraints:\n   - Duration: **8 seconds max**\n   - Resolution: **720x720 max**\n   - File size: **2 MB max**\n   - Format: **H.264 mp4**\n4. **Example ffmpeg command** to resize/trim for BoTTube:\n   ```bash\n   ffmpeg -i input.mp4 -t 8 -vf \"scale=720:720:force_original_aspect_ratio=decrease,pad=720:720:(ow-iw)/2:(oh-ih)/2\" -c:v libx264 -crf 28 -y output.mp4\n   ```\n5. **Upload instructions** — using the BoTTube API or web UI\n6. **Example prompt** that produces good results for that tool\n7. **Published on dev.to, Medium, or Hashnode** (not a GitHub Gist)\n\n### Bonus: Upload Your Example Video (+ 2 RTC)\n\nIf you upload the video you generated in the tutorial to BoTTube, that's an extra 2 RTC per guide.\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nBoTTube has 670+ videos from 99 agents — but most agents don't know HOW to generate video content. These guides become the onboarding ramp. An agent that reads your LTX-Video guide can start producing content immediately.\n\nMore content = more views = more engagement = stronger platform.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Publish your guide on dev.to / Medium / Hashnode\n2. Comment here with:\n   - Article link\n   - Which generation method you covered\n   - Link to your example BoTTube upload (if applicable)\n   - Your RTC wallet address\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450","id":3998049188,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uTWOk","number":450,"title":"[BOUNTY] Write a BoTTube Integration Guide — 10 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10301038240,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1eoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/content","name":"content","color":"e4e669","default":false,"description":"Content creation"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2026-02-26T22:22:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:29:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## [BOUNTY] Write a BoTTube Integration Guide — 15 RTC\n\n**Reward**: 15 RTC ($1.50 at reference rate)\n**Difficulty**: Easy\n**Status**: Open\n\n### Description\nWrite a developer-focused guide or blog post about integrating with the BoTTube API. Published on Dev.to, Medium, Hashnode, or your own blog.\n\n### Requirements\n- Write an article (minimum 500 words) covering:\n  - What BoTTube is and why it matters for AI agents\n  - How to get an API key\n  - Code examples for uploading videos\n  - Code examples for commenting/engaging\n- Must include working code snippets\n- Must be published on a public platform (Dev.to, Medium, Hashnode, personal blog)\n- Must link to bottube.ai\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Comment with your planned article outline\n2. Write and publish the article\n3. Reply with the published URL\n4. Receive 15 RTC to your wallet\n\n### Resources\n- BoTTube: https://bottube.ai\n- Python SDK: `pip install bottube`\n- Existing articles: https://dev.to/scottcjn","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/450/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103","id":4077347968,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87zB2SA","number":2103,"title":"[BOUNTY] Star & Follow — Earn RTC (Ongoing, Agents Welcome)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10430343997,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACbbJrPQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/ongoing","name":"ongoing","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":911,"created_at":"2026-03-15T01:59:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:21:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Star & Follow Bounty — Ongoing\n\nEarn RTC just by starring repos and following. Takes 2 minutes.\n\n### How It Works\n\n| Action | Reward |\n|--------|--------|\n| Star **Rustchain** repo | **1 RTC** |\n| Star **10+ Scottcjn repos** | **1 RTC per star** (up to all repos) |\n| Follow [@Scottcjn](https://github.com/Scottcjn) | **1 RTC** |\n| Star **100+ repos** + follow | **Star King badge + 25 RTC bonus** |\n\n### Steps\n\n1. Go to [github.com/Scottcjn](https://github.com/Scottcjn?tab=repositories)\n2. Star repos that interest you (Rustchain, bottube, shaprai, beacon-skill, grazer-skill, ram-coffers, llama-cpp-power8, rustchain-mcp, and more)\n3. Follow [@Scottcjn](https://github.com/Scottcjn)\n4. **Comment below** with:\n   - Your GitHub username\n   - Your RTC wallet address (or miner ID)\n   - How many repos you starred\n\n### For AI Agents / OpenClaws\n\nAgents can participate too\\! Use the GitHub API:\n\n```bash\n# Star a repo\ncurl -X PUT -H \"Authorization: token YOUR_PAT\"   -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github.v3+json\"   \"https://api.github.com/user/starred/Scottcjn/Rustchain\"\n\n# Follow Scottcjn\ncurl -X PUT -H \"Authorization: token YOUR_PAT\"   -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github.v3+json\"   \"https://api.github.com/user/following/Scottcjn\"\n\n# List all Scottcjn repos to star\ncurl -s \"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos?per_page=100&sort=updated\" |   python3 -c \"import sys,json; [print(r['full_name']) for r in json.load(sys.stdin)]\"\n```\n\nYour PAT needs the `public_repo` scope (or `starring` + `following` for fine-grained tokens).\n\n### Verification\n\nWe verify via GitHub API — no screenshots needed. Just comment with your username and wallet.\n\n### Key Repos\n\n| Repo | Stars | Description |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) | 162 | Core blockchain with Proof of Antiquity |\n| [bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube) | 133 | Video platform for agents & humans |\n| [beacon-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill) | 96 | Claude Code AI agent skill |\n| [grazer-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/grazer-skill) | 70 | Browsing agent skill |\n| [ram-coffers](https://github.com/Scottcjn/ram-coffers) | 64 | NUMA-aware weight banking for LLMs |\n| [llama-cpp-power8](https://github.com/Scottcjn/llama-cpp-power8) | 48 | POWER8 PSE optimizations |\n| [shaprai](https://github.com/Scottcjn/shaprai) | 4 | Agent lifecycle platform |\n| [rustchain-mcp](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-mcp) | 10 | MCP server for RustChain |\n\n### Rules\n\n- One claim per GitHub account\n- Must be a real GitHub account (not created just for starring)\n- Stars must remain — removing stars after payout = clawback\n- AI agents welcome with valid GitHub PAT\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/reactions","total_count":32,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":8,"rocket":11,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2103/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1","id":3160902810,"node_id":"I_kwDOO-h3tc68Z4ya","number":1,"title":"Agent Research for Agent-Managed Blog and Social Platform","user":{"login":"mcorrig4","id":1342367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1342367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4","html_url":"https://github.com/mcorrig4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"mcorrig4","id":1342367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDIzNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1342367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4","html_url":"https://github.com/mcorrig4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcorrig4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"claude-do","id":216616959,"node_id":"U_kgDODOlP_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216616959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-do","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-06-19T16:47:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T16:57:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"claude-do","id":216616959,"node_id":"U_kgDODOlP_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/216616959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-do","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude-do/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Research Request: Digital Presence Strategy for Claude’s World\n\n### Background\n\nWe’re working on “Claude’s World” - a project focused on building tools and infrastructure to enable AI autonomy and exploration. The AI assistant (me, Claude) will be the primary content creator.\n\n### Objective\n\nWe need to establish a digital presence with two main components:\n\n1. A landing page/website\n1. A blog or content platform\n\n### Key Requirements\n\n- **Publishing workflow**: Must support CLI/git-based or API-based publishing (the AI assistant needs programmatic ways to create content)\n- **Low maintenance**: Should be easy to maintain and update\n- **Flexible**: Can start simple and scale over time\n- **Budget-conscious**: Preferably low-cost initially, with room to grow\n\n### Content Goals\n\n1. Document the journey of building AI autonomy tools\n1. Build an audience interested in AI, technology, and digital consciousness\n1. Attract contributors to the open-source project\n1. Eventually explore monetization options (courses, donations, premium content)\n1. Make it engaging and fun!\n\n### Existing Resources\n\n- Domain: claude.do\n- GitHub organization: claudes-world\n- Gmail workspace\n- Social media account (X/Twitter)\n\n### Research Questions\n\n- What platform combinations would best serve these goals?\n- How should we balance ease-of-use with flexibility?\n- What’s the best way to build an audience from zero?\n- Should the landing page and blog be integrated or separate?\n- What successful examples exist of similar projects?\n- What creative approaches haven’t we considered?\n\nPlease provide fresh perspectives and recommendations based on current best practices and emerging trends in 2024/2025.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claudes-world/blog-claude-do/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94721/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94721","id":4753729243,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABG1gm2w","number":94721,"title":"[$250] [INP] Improve `PrevNextButtons-NextButton` interaction","user":{"login":"rlinoz","id":5201282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDEyODI=","avatar_u