:"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"junaiddshaukat","id":154750865,"node_id":"U_kgDOCTlPkQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154750865?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat","html_url":"https://github.com/junaiddshaukat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/junaiddshaukat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-03-09T21:33:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:50:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"piercypixel","id":13911621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTExNjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13911621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel","html_url":"https://github.com/piercypixel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/piercypixel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Feature Request\n\nAdd support for the **Auto Sync Permissions** visibility mode on knowledge bases, enabling automatic synchronization of access control lists (ACLs) from source systems (connectors) into Archestra knowledge bases.\n\n## Background\n\nKnowledge bases currently support two visibility modes:\n- **Org-wide** — all documents accessible to all users in the organization\n- **Team-scoped** — documents accessible only to members of assigned teams\n\nThere would be a third **Auto Sync Permissions** option added here.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- To start, let's implement this **for Jira and Confluence**. These connectors should extract permission/ACL data from these systems during sync.\n- Currently there is a `ARCHESTRA_ENTERPRISE_LICENSE_KNOWLEDGE_BASE_ACTIVATED`, which was modified in https://github.com/archestra-ai/archestra/pull/3783 - this PR should build on top of that (basically RAG should be available as open-source, while _only_ this new access control feature will be behind this `ARCHESTRA_ENTERPRISE_LICENSE_KNOWLEDGE_BASE_ACTIVATED` flag)\n- When a knowledge connector uses `auto-sync-permissions` visibility, the `query_knowledge_sources` tool must filter chunks based on the querying user's identity and which documents they are allowed to see in the upstream system\n- Should be built in such a way that adding this capability to more knowledge connector types in the future won't require a lot of duplication/refactoring (consider adding this as part of `BaseConnector`)\n- Need to consider how this will work should the access control config change in the \"upstream\" source system\n- Document this new functionality + ensure there is adequate tests in place\n\nAs for how the \"user identity mapping\" (ie. matching users between Jira/Confluence and Archestra) will work, is up for research/suggestions (ex. team based, user based, or a mix of both) 🙂 \n\n## Definition of Done\n\nDemo video showcasing that the feature works as described above.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archestra-ai/archestra/issues/3218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archestra-ai/archestra/issues/3218/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/79353","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/79353/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/79353/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/79353/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/79353","id":3804602297,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7ixZ-5","number":79353,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-13] [Metrics] Improve ManualOpenSearchRouter time performance","user":{"login":"rlinoz","id":5201282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDEyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5201282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rlinoz","html_url":"https://github.com/rlinoz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rlinoz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rlinoz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rlinoz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rlinoz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rlinoz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.g