s":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/46364/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/issues/443","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/issues/443/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/issues/443/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/issues/443/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/issues/443","id":4818869611,"node_id":"I_kwDORPHess8AAAABHzodaw","number":443,"title":"tinygrad Weekly Digest — 2026-07-06 (8 msgs)","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10197549679,"node_id":"LA_kwDORPHess8AAAACX9JCbw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/labels/digest","name":"digest","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10205207452,"node_id":"LA_kwDORPHess8AAAACYEcbnA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/labels/tinygrad","name":"tinygrad","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-06T11:58:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T11:58:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## DAILY BRIEF - 2026-07-06\n\n**TL;DR**\nPerformance optimization in `tinygrad` is being actively explored, with a focus on cache hint handling for CUDA, indicating a push for more efficient GPU utilization.\n\n---\n\n### TINYGRAD & INFRA\n\n*   **`tinygrad` BEAM search lacks cache hint optimization, impacting CUDA performance.** — `daboss2622` observed that `tinygrad`'s BEAM search doesn't optimize cache hints for CUDA operations, leading to inefficient memory access patterns. As `daboss2622` put it: \"It dosent seem like BEAM search has any handling for optimizing cache hints.\"\n\n*   **Potential for `tinygrad` cache hint optimization via `OptOps`.** — `daboss2622` is considering adding cache hint optimization as an `OptOps` to improve `tinygrad`'s performance. As `daboss2622` put it: \"Shud I try to add this as a OptOps maybe?\"\n\n---\n\n### GPU/TPU/HARDWARE\n\nNothing today.\n\n---\n\n### MODEL & TRAINING\n\n*   **MLPerf flux training bounty faces memory bottlenecks.** — `morhimanshu` is encountering memory limitations while working on the MLPerf flux training bounty, despite having the model file ready. As `morhimanshu` put it: \"I want to work on the mlperf flux training bounty, I have the model file ( around 500 lines) ready but I am memory bottlenecked.\"\n\n---\n\n### SENTIMENT SHIFTS\n\nNothing today.\n\n---\n\n### LINKS WORTH CLICKING\n\nNothing today.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/issues/443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaisong123/eleuther-digest/issues/443/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94318","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94318/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94318/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94318/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94318","id":4726550952,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABGblxqA","number":94318,"title":"[$250] [DEV] Console error when opening a newly created expense on the Spend page","user":{"login":"m-natarajan","id":38435837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM1ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38435837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan","html_url":"https://github.com/m-natarajan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/rec