ktoberfest, community, low hanging fruit, up-for-grabs, first-timers-only |\n| 5 | UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters | [[ Crypto ] Fix reentrancy vulnerability in StakingVault withdraw and claimRewards](https://github.com/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/911) | good first issue, help wanted, 💎 Bounty, AI Agent friendly, AI only allowed - no humans, $450 |\n| 6 | christiandionisio/claude-tetris | [Toggle Light Dark](https://github.com/christiandionisio/claude-tetris/issues/5) | enhancement, good first issue |\n| 7 | imuniqueshiv/MeetOnMemory | [📝 Fix GitHub Issue Templates Not Displaying on the New Issue Page](https://github.com/imuniqueshiv/MeetOnMemory/issues/62) | enhancement, help wanted, good first issue, ECSoC26, good-issue, optimization |\n| 8 | dmzoneill-forks/dash-2-x | [[#2557] Clear notifications counter when app window gets focus](https://github.com/dmzoneill-forks/dash-2-x/issues/55) | enhancement, good first issue, upstream-issue, triaged |\n| 9 | dmzoneill-forks/dash-2-x | [[#2230] Add to Change Border radius ](https://github.com/dmzoneill-forks/dash-2-x/issues/140) | enhancement, good first issue, upstream-issue, triaged |\n| 10 | dmzoneill-forks/dash-2-x | [[#2614] [feature] Focus application when drag a file into icon](https://github.com/dmzoneill-forks/dash-2-x/issues/41) | enhancement, good first issue, upstream-issue, triaged |\n| 11 | tuttle-dev/tuttle | [Import from Document: Improve Import Quality for Fixed Price Invoices](https://github.com/tuttle-dev/tuttle/issues/383) | bug, good first issue, backend, UX/UI |\n| 12 | Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties | [[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Star + Review an Open PR](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782) | good first issue, bounty, onboarding |\n| 13 | Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties | [[ONBOARD: 2 RTC] Star + Compare RustChain to Another Blockchain Project](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786) | good first issue, bounty, community, onboarding |\n| 14 | MakazhanAlpamys/Soup | [PRM-guided GRPO: batch the PRM reward forward pass (currently one forward per completion)](https://github.com/MakazhanAlpamys/Soup/issues/298) | enhancement, good first issue |\n| 15 | schmug/colophon | [Tighten test_dialogue follow-up assertion to also check the element name](https://github.com/schmug/colophon/issues/39) | good first issue, needs-decision |\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/3ni8ma/aarushkarak-website/issues/133/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4710","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4710/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4710/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4710/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-omni/issues/4710","id":4741674978,"node_id":"I_kwDOPtqWvc8AAAABGqA34g","number":4710,"title":"[RFC]:  Ref-Target KV Cache for Video Diffusion Models","user":{"login":"evanchueng","id":1144463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDQ0NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1144463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchueng","html_url":"https://github.com/evanchueng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchueng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchueng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchueng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchueng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/evanchueng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gi